### UStudent API - Health Check & Debug Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Application Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Flyway Migration Status
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/flyway

### Debug: All Course Schedules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules

### Debug: CS101 Schedules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/1

### Debug: CS201 Schedules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/2

### Debug: MATH101 Schedules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/3

### Debug: MATH201 Schedules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/4

### Debug: ENG101 Schedules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/schedules/5